  <jpcrp_cor:ReconciliationOfEndingBalanceOfCashAndCashEquivalentsWithAccountBalancesPerBalanceSheetTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※１  現金及び現金同等物の期末残高と貸借対照表に掲記されている科目の金額との関係&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="align_left" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:437.7pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:145.7pt;min-width:145.7pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:146pt;min-width:146pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:146pt;min-width:146pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:34pt;min-height:34pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:49.6pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-17.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
